TLDR: This paper analyzes and solves the optimization problem of the performance of a multi-antenna unmanned aerial vehicle (UAV)-aided NOMA multi-user pairing system and proposes an algorithm to optimize the transmission power of UAVs to maximize the system's energy efficiency.},
