huang2025LI2NewLearningbased\\
TLDR: A learning-based algorithm is developed to enhance the current route iteratively, utilizing guidance from a deep reinforcement learning (DRL) agent and executing a series of operations to potentially decrease AoI while adhering to topological and energy constraints.},
  file = {/Users/wupengfei/Zotero/storage/YKI3SWBQ/huang2025LI2NewLearningbased.pdf}
}

